# Build output — Vercel's Build Output API. If this is present at deploy
# time, Vercel skips its own build and redeploys whatever is checked in
# here verbatim, so a committed copy silently freezes the app at whatever
# state it was in when it got committed. Always let Vercel build fresh.
.vercel/output/
